  B("মে মাসে বিক্রি সামান্য কমেছে।",["Sales fell slightly in May.","Sales felt slightly in May.","Sales were fallen slight in May.","Sales fell slight on May."],"Sales fell slightly in May.","Fall-fell + adverb."),
